      len = size;
  } else {
      len = mtu - skb->len;
      if (len < size)
          len = maxfraglen - skb->len;
  }
  ```

  This part ensures that GSO packets are properly recognized and assigns the length `len` accordingly, preventing conditions that could lead to the negative 'copy' scenario.

